255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (Multiple classification models were evaluated to predict customer churn, including Logistic Regression and Decision Tree approaches, with class imbalance explicitly addressed to avoid biased results. Model selection and tuning prioritized recall to ensure high-risk customers were identified early for proactive retention. All preprocessing and optimization steps were confined to training data to ensure reliable evaluation. Performance was assessed using recall and Precision-Recall AUC, supported by complementary diagnostics, to balance coverage of churn risk with operational efficiency.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
